.Dd November 10, 2026
.Dt NANOSLEEP 2
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm nanosleep
.Nd sleep for a nanosecond interval
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Ft int
.Fn nanosleep "u64 ns"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The .Nm system call sleeps for at least .Fa ns nanoseconds.
.Pp
This page documents the native RavenBSD ABI; see the
.Pa raven-abi
crate for the exact numeric value and types.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
On success .Nm returns a non-negative value; on failure it returns a negative error number.
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD ABI v1.
